## Files to Modify

### 1. `internal/webui/frontend/src/utils/issueCategory.ts` (line 59-62)

Replace the current `isPRUrl` implementation:

```typescript
export function isPRUrl(ref?: string | null): boolean {
  if (!ref) return false;
  try {
    const url = new URL(ref);
    if (url.protocol !== 'https:' && url.protocol !== 'http:') return false;
    return url.pathname.includes('/pull/') || url.pathname.includes('/pulls/');
  } catch {
    return false;
  }
}
```

Key changes:
- Wraps in try/catch since `new URL()` throws on malformed input (which should return false)
- Validates protocol is `https:` or `http:` — rejects `javascript:`, `data:`, `vbscript:`, etc.
- Checks pathname (not full string) for `/pull/` — prevents path-injection via query params or fragments

