## Summary

Add per-workspace connection status indicators to the WorkspaceTree sidebar. Each workspace repo entry shows its connection health: connected (clean default — no extra chrome), disconnected (solid orange dot with live elapsed time counter), or reconnecting (pulsing orange dot). When the SSE connection is fully lost (reconnect attempts exhausted), an inline "Connection lost" prompt appears at the bottom of the WorkspaceTree content area with a Retry button. The collapsed sidebar badge shifts from green to orange during disconnection.

