This task adds repository information to the AgentCard component (as a 3rd info line) and to the AgentDetailPanel (as a new \"Repositories\" row in the Info tab's info grid). It also replaces locally-duplicated color utility functions with imports from the shared `utils/colorUtils.ts` and `components/RepoBadge` created by the prerequisite task loomcli-y5vpk.26. When an agent has no repo assignment, these elements are simply not rendered — no visual change in single-repo mode.

## Technical Approach

**High-level strategy:** Add a compact repo line below the existing role line in AgentCard's `.info` column, using the RepoBadge component for the colored pill and a muted cross_repo indicator (↔ symbol) inline. In AgentDetailPanel, add a \"Repos\" row to the existing `<dl className={styles.infoGrid}>` section that renders RepoBadge(s) and cross_repo status. Both files also get their duplicated color utils replaced with shared imports.

